    <briefdescription>
<para>Plugin interface for LoRA-based document scoring. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implement this interface to supply a real LoRA adapter scorer. The <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_heuristic_lo_r_a_scorer" kindref="compound">HeuristicLoRAScorer</ref></computeroutput> provides a lightweight token-overlap baseline.</para>
<para>Thread safety: <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_i_lo_r_a_scorer_1a6dd7e3e8c22fa8ab4669ef55ad968d26" kindref="member">score()</ref></computeroutput> must be callable from multiple threads. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
